{
"markdown": "### DockPremium\n\n**Add photos and videos to your iPhone Dock.** Bring a livelier, more personalized look to your Home Screen Dock.\n\n> **Note:** If you want more features added, contact the developer on Telegram at **@quyluong21**.",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
},
{
"class": "DepictionScreenshotsView",
"screenshots": [
{
"url": "https://jtisvn.github.io/infodeb/DockPremium/Screenshots/1.png",
"accessibilityText": "Screenshot 1"
},
{
"url": "https://jtisvn.github.io/infodeb/DockPremium/Screenshots/2.png",
"accessibilityText": "Screenshot 2"
}
],
"itemCornerRadius": 12,
"itemSize": "{185,400}"
},
{
"markdown": "- **Key Features:**\n\n- **Dock Photo & Video Backgrounds:** Set photos or videos as your Dock background, with an optional video audio toggle (muted by default) and live updates.\n- **Flexible Media Sources:** Pick photos or videos from Files (On My iPhone and iCloud Drive) or directly from your Photos library.\n- **Library Management:** Preview, set as background, rename, or delete saved media right in settings.\n- **Floating Quick Switcher:** Enable a floating button on the Home Screen to switch between saved media, with custom icon support and default button reset.\n- **Feature Requests:** Reach out on Telegram at **@quyluong21** if you want more features added.",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
},
